#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Setup instructions for IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud to submit Qiskit SDK and "
"Qiskit Runtime jobs for users with email invitations"
msgstr ""
"Mga tagubilin sa pag-set up ng IBM Quantum sa IBM Cloud para sa pagsumite ng"
" mga Qiskit SDK at Qiskit Runtime jobs para sa mga user na may email "
"invitation"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up your IBM Cloud account - invited users"
msgstr "I-set up ang iyong IBM Cloud account - mga invited na user"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up your IBM Cloud account - invited users {#set-up-your-ibm-cloud-"
"account-invited-users}"
msgstr ""
"I-set up ang iyong IBM Cloud account - mga invited na user {#set-up-your-"
"ibm-cloud-account-invited-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not have an invitation from an administrator to join an account "
"that an administrator set up, contact your administrator.  If you need to "
"set up your own account, follow the steps in [Set up your IBM Cloud "
"account](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung wala kang invitation mula sa isang administrator para sumali sa account"
" na na-set up ng administrator, makipag-ugnayan sa iyong administrator. Kung"
" kailangan mong i-set up ang sarili mong account, sundin ang mga hakbang sa "
"[I-set up ang iyong IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can run workloads on IBM&reg; quantum processing units (QPUs) by setting"
" up an account on IBM Cloud&reg;. You will also need to [install and set up "
"Qiskit and Qiskit Runtime](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari kang magpatakbo ng mga workload sa IBM&reg; quantum processing units "
"(QPUs) sa pamamagitan ng pag-set up ng account sa IBM Cloud&reg;. "
"Kakailanganin mo ring [i-install at i-set up ang Qiskit at Qiskit "
"Runtime](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Your user account is associated with one or more "
"[instances](/guides/instances), identified by _Cloud Resource Names_ (CRNs) "
"that give access to IBM Quantum services. Additionally, a unique API token "
"(also called a key) is assigned to each account, allowing for IBM Quantum "
"access from Qiskit.  For instructions to choose a specific instance, see "
"[Connect to an instance](/guides/instances#connect-instance).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang iyong user account ay nauugnay sa isa o higit pang [mga "
"instance](/guides/instances), na tinutukoy ng _Cloud Resource Names_ (CRNs) "
"na nagbibigay ng access sa mga serbisyo ng IBM Quantum. Bukod pa rito, isang"
" natatanging API token (tinatawag ding key) ang itinalaga sa bawat account, "
"na nagbibigay-daan sa IBM Quantum access mula sa Qiskit. Para sa mga "
"tagubilin sa pagpili ng isang partikular na instance, tingnan ang [Kumonekta"
" sa isang instance](/guides/instances#connect-instance).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      The [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) and the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) list the instances that you can access.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      Ang [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) at ang [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) ay naglilista ng mga instance na maaari mong ma-access.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use IBM Cloud {#set-up-to-use-ibm-cloud}"
msgstr "I-set up para gamitin ang IBM Cloud {#set-up-to-use-ibm-cloud}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Bago ka magsimula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Accept the email invitation.\n"
msgstr "Tanggapin ang email invitation.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log in with an IBMid or Google account.  Note that the profile that you use "
"to log in to IBM Cloud or IBM Quantum Platform in this step is not your IBM "
"Cloud account.  After logging in, confirm your information and accept the "
"invitation to join the account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mag-log in gamit ang IBMid o Google account. Tandaan na ang profile na "
"ginagamit mo para mag-log in sa IBM Cloud o IBM Quantum Platform sa hakbang "
"na ito ay hindi ang iyong IBM Cloud account. Pagkatapos mag-log in, "
"kumpirmahin ang iyong impormasyon at tanggapin ang invitation para sumali sa"
" account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate back to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Bumalik sa [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account "
"switcher in the header, as shown in the following image.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tiyaking napili ang tamang account at rehiyon sa account switcher sa header,"
" tulad ng ipinapakita sa sumusunod na larawan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the account that was invited in the email.\n"
msgstr "Piliin ang account na na-invite sa email.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The region controls where your jobs are run and where the job data is kept. "
"You can access either region by using the same API key, but you can only see"
" and access the instances that were created in the region that you're logged"
" in to.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kinokontrol ng rehiyon kung saan pinapatakbo ang iyong mga job at kung saan "
"iniimbak ang data ng job. Maa-access mo ang alinmang rehiyon gamit ang "
"parehong API key, ngunit makikita at maa-access mo lang ang mga instance na "
"nilikha sa rehiyong naka-log in ka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is to "
"the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is to the right of the "
"account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.svg 'IBM "
"Quantum Platform header')\n"
msgstr ""
"    ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is to "
"the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is to the right of the "
"account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.svg 'IBM "
"Quantum Platform header')\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. Optional: Save your access credentials {#2-optional-save-your-access-"
"credentials}"
msgstr ""
"2. Opsyonal: I-save ang iyong mga access credential {#2-optional-save-your-"
"access-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are using a trusted Python environment, such as a personal laptop, it"
" is recommended that you use the `save_account()` method to [save your "
"credentials locally](/guides/save-credentials).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung gumagamit ka ng pinagkakatiwalaang Python environment, tulad ng "
"personal na laptop, inirerekomenda na gamitin ang `save_account()` na paraan"
" para [i-save ang iyong mga kredensyal nang lokal](/guides/save-"
"credentials).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Connect Qiskit with your service instance {#3-connect-qiskit-with-your-"
"service-instance}"
msgstr ""
"3. Ikonekta ang Qiskit sa iyong service instance {#3-connect-qiskit-with-"
"your-service-instance}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Initialize the service](/guides/initialize-account) in a **trusted Python "
"environment**\n"
msgstr ""
"[I-initialize ang serbisyo](/guides/initialize-account) sa isang "
"**pinagkakatiwalaang Python environment**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Initialize the service in an **untrusted environment**](/guides/cloud-"
"setup-untrusted) (such as a public computer)\n"
msgstr ""
"[I-initialize ang serbisyo sa isang **hindi pinagkakatiwalaang "
"environment**](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) (tulad ng isang pampublikong "
"computer)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"   * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"   * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga Tala\">\n"
"   * Sundin ang [mga tagubiling ito](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) kung gusto mong kumonekta gamit ang REST API sa halip na Qiskit.\n"
"   * Kung kinakailangan, gamitin ang [impormasyong ito](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) para i-configure ang iyong firewall upang ma-enable ang access sa mga IBM Quantum API endpoint.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  -  [Overview of available plans](plans-overview).\n"
"  -  [Configure the Qiskit SDK locally](configure-qiskit-local).\n"
"  -  [Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
"  -  Follow the steps in the [Run your first circuit on hardware](/guides/hello-world) guide to write and run a quantum program.\n"
"  -  Try a [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"  -  [Pangkalahatang-ideya ng mga available na plano](plans-overview).\n"
"  -  [I-configure ang Qiskit SDK nang lokal](configure-qiskit-local).\n"
"  -  [I-set up para gamitin ang IBM Quantum Platform gamit ang REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
"  -  Sundin ang mga hakbang sa gabay na [I-run ang iyong unang circuit sa hardware](/guides/hello-world) para sumulat at magpatakbo ng quantum program.\n"
"  -  Subukan ang isang [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
